On Host Machine -----

        1. Install Ollama 
        2. Pull required model 
        3. Check status of the Ollama service 
        4. vi /etc/systemd/system/ollama.server
        5. ADD: Environment="OLLAMA_HOST=0.0.0.0:11434" below [service] header 
        5. systemctl daemon-reload 
        6. systemctl restart ollama
        7. ss -tulnp | grep 11434  - Should be *:11434 ----- means it not working on only local host.
        8. Mode required changes in security group OR NLA to access. 

On Client Machine -------

        1. telnet <Host Machine IP> 11434 ---should be working 
        2. And call that model using REST API calls. Example below:

                response = requests.post(
                         "http://<Host Machine IP>:11434/api/generate",
                          json={
                                "model": "llama3.1",
                                "prompt": "Hello"
                               }
                             )


                          
        
